{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "ruleId": "task_reaction",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "gonogo.commission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "gonogo.omission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "gonogo.d_prime"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "independent_summary",
      "text": "Go/No-Go观察的是：该出手时作答、该停时克制。误按次数要对应No-Go试次，遗漏率要对应Go试次；d′帮助描述本次规则辨别，不能单独作为自控能力等级。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "gonogo.commission_rate",
        "gonogo.omission_rate",
        "gonogo.d_prime"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "project_protocol"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "task_attention",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.d_prime"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.omission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.commission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.rt_icv"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "independent_summary",
      "text": "CPT-X观察的是一段连续活动中的目标辨别和反应稳定性。请一起看遗漏、误报与反应时变异；遗漏只对应目标试次，不能用全部试次作分母。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "cpt.d_prime",
        "cpt.omission_rate",
        "cpt.commission_rate",
        "cpt.rt_icv"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "project_protocol"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "task_interference",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "flanker.flanker_effect_ms"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "flanker.congruent_accuracy"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "flanker.incongruent_accuracy"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "independent_summary",
      "text": "Flanker观察的是周围箭头与目标不一致时的干扰。毫秒差值保留正负，并与两条件准确率一起看；较快反应可能伴随错误，单个差值不能判定能力高低。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "flanker.flanker_effect_ms",
        "flanker.congruent_accuracy",
        "flanker.incongruent_accuracy"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "project_protocol"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "daily_self_report",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "texi.working_memory"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "texi.inhibition"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "independent_summary",
      "text": "TEXI来自你对日常生活的回顾：工作记忆9题、抑制与自我调节11题，各为1–5题均分。高分表示你报告的困难较多，不能看成学习能力或智力分数。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "texi.working_memory",
        "texi.inhibition"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "texi_2020",
        "texi_scoring"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "methods_complement",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "gonogo.commission_rate"
