            "evidenceKey": "texi.working_memory"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "texi.inhibition"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "joint_conclusion",
      "text": "这次有了两种视角：有明确规则的任务表现，以及你对平时学习和生活的体验。它们帮助提出观察问题，不能互相换算；即使数字看起来不同，也不说明谁不诚实或谁的结果错误。可以回想睡眠、干扰、任务兴趣和当时状态，挑一个具体场景继续观察。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "gonogo.commission_rate",
        "gonogo.omission_rate",
        "gonogo.d_prime",
        "cpt.d_prime",
        "cpt.omission_rate",
        "cpt.commission_rate",
        "cpt.rt_icv",
        "flanker.flanker_effect_ms",
        "flanker.congruent_accuracy",
        "flanker.incongruent_accuracy",
        "texi.working_memory",
        "texi.inhibition"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "toplak_2013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "action_pause",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "gonogo.commission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "texi.inhibition"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "cross_source_condition",
      "text": "下次开始功课前，先说清“什么时候开始、什么时候暂停”。为手机设一个固定位置，先做一个短步骤；一周后回顾是否更容易开始和停下。这里提供可尝试的学习策略，不保证训练某项能力。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "gonogo.commission_rate",
        "texi.inhibition"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "project_protocol"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "action_steps",
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "cpt.omission_rate"
          },
          {
            "op": "present",
            "evidenceKey": "texi.working_memory"
          }
        ]
      },
      "kind": "cross_source_condition",
      "text": "把一项较长作业写成两三个清楚步骤，一次只展开当前步骤。中途分心后先查看清单再继续，并记录哪个环境更容易回到任务。",
      "evidenceKeys": [
        "cpt.omission_rate",
        "texi.working_memory"
      ],
      "supportRefs": [
        "project_protocol"
      ]
    },
